/***********************************************************************
 *
 *    Design:
 *      - Hash table for O(1) lookup by sector number.
 *      - LRU doubly-linked list for eviction.
 *      - Dirty doubly-linked list for background flush.
 *      - All disk I/O executes OUTSIDE the spinlock.
 *      - Background kernel thread flushes dirty buffers every 800 ms.
 *
 *    Portability:
 *      - __SECTOR_T  is pointer-width (32-bit now, 64-bit ready).
 ***********************************************************************/

